{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1747029536\" /></div><strong>Grim Pastures</strong> is a multiplayer survival game with social deduction elements. Set in the nostalgic farming environment of the 1970s, each player portrays a different seasonal worker. However, a threat lurks on the farm: a serial killer has hidden among the villagers, aiming to sabotage the production process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has a unique role. The lumberjack can wield an axe more powerfully, while the trapper can set traps to incapacitate others. Fields need to be harvested, vegetables planted, animals milked, and daily orders completed. But on this farm, you can't trust anyone \u2014 because everyone might be lying. If you're a villager, focus on working together to survive, while if you're the killer, stay hidden and sabotage everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work begins every day, but not everyone will make it to the end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445760?t=1747029536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445760?t=1747029536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/96c0fbccbfc0b3c33c5de91a2c76b173c5b7e070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747029536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/96c0fbccbfc0b3c33c5de91a2c76b173c5b7e070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747029536","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1747029536\" /></div><strong>Grim Pastures</strong> is a multiplayer survival game with social deduction elements. Set in the nostalgic farming environment of the 1970s, each player portrays a different seasonal worker. However, a threat lurks on the farm: a serial killer has hidden among the villagers, aiming to sabotage the production process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has a unique role. The lumberjack can wield an axe more powerfully, while the trapper can set traps to incapacitate others. Fields need to be harvested, vegetables planted, animals milked, and daily orders completed. But on this farm, you can't trust anyone \u2014 because everyone might be lying. If you're a villager, focus on working together to survive, while if you're the killer, stay hidden and sabotage everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work begins every day, but not everyone will make it to the end.</p>","developers":["7hGameStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445760/56321d13b1c5d97213a4bced96262f9f89cdd4b2/header.jpg?t=1747029536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136257,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136257/movie480.mp4?t=1746606100","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136257/movie_max.mp4?t=1746606100"},"name":"Grim Pastures - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136257/25e8f3d3b01a29c4c6aa8191530141dfe47e56d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746606100","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.